{
  "name": "Galacs.io – WF5 Auction Auto-Close",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a58849e7-21ec-4a40-bda4-eee40958bc2a",
      "name": "Schedule – Every 5 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -960,
        144
      ],
      "notes": "Vérifie toutes les 5 minutes les enchères expirées.\nClose_at < now() → déclenche la clôture automatique."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://odoo.world-wild-web.fr/web/dataset/call_kw",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Galacs-Token",
              "value": "HrIK+XDsHz1U6stPLD6myvvU3ZGkMlMV+mua5WO0FR4SdGSK+0V2AAT2UUp1l1o2yODbk82NCvOsEc5BBZfCvmYb+3alYW8EcjoXckICJDhaq/cqvqDV5L/lAQ=="
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"method\": \"call\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"model\": \"galacs.enchere\",\n    \"method\": \"search_read\",\n    \"args\": [[\n      [\"state\", \"=\", \"active\"],\n      [\"close_at\", \"<\", \"{{ new Date().toISOString() }}\"]\n    ]],\n    \"kwargs\": {\n      \"fields\": [\"id\", \"lead_id\", \"close_at\", \"state\", \"current_bid\", \"winning_agent_id\"],\n      \"limit\": 50\n    }\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "dc46aeeb-8141-4649-81ca-605d37cfe956",
      "name": "Fetch Expired Auctions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -720,
        144
      ],
      "notes": "Récupère toutes les enchères actives dont close_at < maintenant.\nModèle Odoo : galacs.enchere\nStatut : active"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const response = $input.first().json;\nconst auctions = response.result || [];\n\nif (!Array.isArray(auctions) || auctions.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: { expired_count: 0, auctions: [], message: 'No expired auctions found.' } }];\n}\n\nreturn auctions.map(auction => ({\n  json: {\n    auction_id: auction.id,\n    lead_id: Array.isArray(auction.lead_id) ? auction.lead_id[0] : auction.lead_id,\n    lead_name: Array.isArray(auction.lead_id) ? auction.lead_id[1] : 'Lead #' + auction.lead_id,\n    close_at: auction.close_at,\n    current_bid: auction.current_bid || 0,\n    winning_agent_id: Array.isArray(auction.winning_agent_id) ? auction.winning_agent_id[0] : null,\n    winning_agent_name: Array.isArray(auction.winning_agent_id) ? auction.winning_agent_id[1] : null,\n    has_winner: !!auction.winning_agent_id\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "e66640c2-b6c2-4b59-88b9-f7296a0cfebe",
      "name": "Parse Expired Auctions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -480,
        144
      ],
      "notes": "Parse la réponse Odoo.\nExtrait les données d'enchère : lead, enchère max, agent gagnant.\nDétecte si l'enchère a un gagnant ou non."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-winner-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.has_winner }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "388c2225-4817-4a01-b7ee-df02392215df",
      "name": "Has Winner?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        144
      ],
      "notes": "true  → enchère avec gagnant → clôturer et attribuer le lead\nfalse → enchère sans offre → clôturer et remettre en pipeline"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://odoo.world-wild-web.fr/api/encheres/close",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Galacs-Token",
              "value": "HrIK+XDsHz1U6stPLD6myvvU3ZGkMlMV+mua5WO0FR4SdGSK+0V2AAT2UUp1l1o2yODbk82NCvOsEc5BBZfCvmYb+3alYW8EcjoXckICJDhaq/cqvqDV5L/lAQ=="
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"auction_id\": {{ $json.auction_id }},\n  \"lead_id\": {{ $json.lead_id }},\n  \"winning_agent_id\": {{ $json.winning_agent_id }},\n  \"final_bid\": {{ $json.current_bid }},\n  \"action\": \"close_with_winner\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "455f726c-5a62-4b6d-9d6a-ec60c9b9446d",
      "name": "Close Auction – Assign Winner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Clôture l'enchère et attribue le lead à l'agent gagnant.\nEndpoint Odoo : POST /api/encheres/close\nDéverrouille les contacts privés pour l'agent gagnant."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://odoo.world-wild-web.fr/api/encheres/close",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Galacs-Token",
              "value": "HrIK+XDsHz1U6stPLD6myvvU3ZGkMlMV+mua5WO0FR4SdGSK+0V2AAT2UUp1l1o2yODbk82NCvOsEc5BBZfCvmYb+3alYW8EcjoXckICJDhaq/cqvqDV5L/lAQ=="
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"auction_id\": {{ $json.auction_id }},\n  \"lead_id\": {{ $json.lead_id }},\n  \"winning_agent_id\": null,\n  \"final_bid\": 0,\n  \"action\": \"close_no_bid\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "78e7916c-145f-472f-acb1-c20d0b30f84c",
      "name": "Close Auction – No Bids",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        288
      ],
      "notes": "Enchère expirée sans offre → remet le lead dans le pipeline general.\nEndpoint Odoo : POST /api/encheres/close avec action=close_no_bid"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://odoo.world-wild-web.fr/api/notifications/remind",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Galacs-Token",
              "value": "HrIK+XDsHz1U6stPLD6myvvU3ZGkMlMV+mua5WO0FR4SdGSK+0V2AAT2UUp1l1o2yODbk82NCvOsEc5BBZfCvmYb+3alYW8EcjoXckICJDhaq/cqvqDV5L/lAQ=="
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"agent_id\": {{ $json.winning_agent_id }},\n  \"lead_id\": {{ $json.lead_id }},\n  \"message\": \"🏆 FÉLICITATIONS ! Vous avez remporté l'enchère pour le lead '{{ $json.lead_name }}' avec une offre de {{ $json.current_bid }}€. Les coordonnées du prospect sont maintenant accessibles dans votre CRM Privé.\",\n  \"type\": \"auction_won\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "3012a86a-eb52-408c-a18a-b34128c9ba84",
      "name": "Notify Winning Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Envoie une notification SSE à l'agent gagnant.\nConfirme l'attribution du lead et le déverrouillage des contacts privés."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const closeResult = $('Close Auction – Assign Winner').first()?.json || {};\nconst lead = $('Parse Expired Auctions').first()?.json || {};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    status: 'auction_closed_with_winner',\n    auction_id: lead.auction_id,\n    lead_id: lead.lead_id,\n    lead_name: lead.lead_name,\n    winning_agent: lead.winning_agent_name,\n    final_bid: lead.current_bid,\n    closed_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "7fba1f5d-5ef2-4c67-af38-5448f2920e99",
      "name": "Log Final – Winner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Log final : enchère clôturée avec gagnant."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const closeResult = $('Close Auction – No Bids').first()?.json || {};\nconst lead = $('Parse Expired Auctions').first()?.json || {};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    status: 'auction_closed_no_bids',\n    auction_id: lead.auction_id,\n    lead_id: lead.lead_id,\n    lead_name: lead.lead_name,\n    closed_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    action: 'lead_returned_to_pipeline'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "0ae9eff6-7862-4b8a-839d-2bb8a4f7219e",
      "name": "Log Final – No Bids",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        288
      ],
      "notes": "Log final : enchère clôturée sans offre, lead remis en pipeline."
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
